# Agent Workflow

Follow `docs/AGENT-WORKFLOW.md`.

1. Read TRACKING.md → pick one item
2. Read matching doc in docs/pages/ or docs/components/
3. Set doc Status to `in-progress`
4. Implement with minimal diff
5. Run Review Checklist in doc
6. Update TRACKING (Review) and doc Status (`review`)
7. After approval: Status `done`, move to Done in TRACKING

Never mark done without updating both TRACKING and the component doc.
